title: "Session host: one channel across dcserver restarts, host loss and terminate"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Recovery
    lg1: Session
    lg2: Path to the PendingEventuallyResolved or RestartEventuallyReconnect or RestartedPendingResolved bug
    lg3: Repeats forever, so PendingEventuallyResolved or RestartEventuallyReconnect or RestartedPendingResolved breaks
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 bugPath
  class lg3 repeats
  s0: No session
  s1: No session, a message waiting
  s2: Creating, a message waiting
  s3: Created, location not yet recorded, a message waiting
  s4: Creating, host server down, a message waiting
  s5: Pending, no pane recorded, host server down, a message waiting
  s6: Pane recorded, only a shell, a message waiting
  s7: No session, host server down, a message waiting
  s8: Pane recorded, provider up, no prompt yet, a message waiting
  s9: No session, host server replaced, a message waiting
  s10: First prompt sent, waiting for its hook
  s11: Creating, host server replaced, a message waiting
  s12: Created, location not yet recorded, host server replaced, a message waiting
  s13: First prompt sent, waiting for its hook (no more messages)
  s14: Pane recorded, only a shell, host server replaced, a message waiting
  s15: dcserver down, provider still running (no more messages)
  s16: Pane recorded, only a shell, host server replaced
  s17: Boot reconcile (after the restart) (no more messages)
  s18: Waiting to re-adopt the created execution (after the restart) (no more messages)
  s19: Pane recorded, provider up, no prompt yet, host server replaced
  s20: Pane recorded, provider up, no prompt yet, host server replaced, a message waiting
  s21: First prompt sent, waiting for its hook, host server replaced (no more messages)
  s22: First prompt taken, its source logged, not bound, host server replaced (no more messages)
  s23: dcserver down, provider still running, host server replaced (no more messages)
  s24: Boot reconcile, host server replaced (after the restart) (no more messages)
  s25: Waiting to re-adopt the created execution, host server replaced (after the restart) (no more messages)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a message arrives
  s1 --> s2: a message reserves a new execution
  s2 --> s3: the host creates it
  s2 --> s4: the host server ends
  s3 --> s3: a host probe stops failing
  s4 --> s4: a host probe stops failing
  s3 --> s6: its pane is recorded
  s4 --> s5: the create reply is lost
  s5 --> s7: the census finds nothing and closes the row
  s6 --> s8: the provider starts in the pane
  s7 --> s9: the host server starts again
  s8 --> s10: the turn sends Codex its first prompt
  s9 --> s11: a message reserves a new execution
  s10 --> s10: a message arrives
  s11 --> s12: the host creates it
  s10 --> s13: the turn is refused: no provider, or its first prompt already taken
  s12 --> s14: its pane is recorded
  s13 --> s15: dcserver stops
  s14 --> s16: the turn is refused: no provider, or its first prompt already taken
  s15 --> s17: dcserver starts
  s16 --> s19: the provider starts in the pane
  s17 --> s18: intake opens
  s19 --> s20: a message arrives
  s20 --> s21: the turn sends Codex its first prompt
  s21 --> s22: Codex's first hook arrives
  s22 --> s23: dcserver stops
  s23 --> s24: dcserver starts
  s24 --> s25: intake opens
